sequenceDiagram
participant U as User
participant F as Frontend
participant B as Backend
participant G as Gemini
participant W as Whisper
participant D as Database
U->>F: Start interview
F->>B: POST /interview/start
B->>G: Generate questions
G-->>B: Questions
B->>D: Store questions
B-->>F: Interview session data
U->>F: Record answer
F->>B: POST /interview/answer
B->>G: Evaluate answer
B->>W: Transcribe audio
W-->>B: Transcript
B->>D: Store results
B-->>F: Evaluation
